abstract: >-
  AgentMesh Gateway is an independent protocol-aware AI coding-agent and model gateway
  with feasibility-first routing, provider fallback, deterministic policy simulation,
  observed cost and latency evidence, local quota controls, and offline adaptive-routing
  research baselines.
